 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's imports of computers from China decreased from 2.06 billion euros in 2005 to 4.3 million euros in 2025.",
  "The imports of telephone sets from China increased dramatically from 633 thousand euros in 2005 to 620.3 million euros in 2025.",
  "The largest change for computers was between 2009 and 2010, dropping from 3.11 billion euros to 714.2 million euros, while telephone sets peaked in 2015 at 2.10 billion euros.",
  "The imports of telephone sets saw a sharp drop between 2019 and 2020, from 1.29 billion euros to 8.4 million euros, contrasting with the steady decline in computer imports after 2008.",
  "All values are in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
